T*
(customers dropped by 45% despite installing modern touchscreen ATMs in bustling market) Tj
T*
(centers.) Tj
T*
(Ethnographic Research via AEIOU Framework:) Tj
T*
(Activities: Users withdrew cash, entered PINs, checked account balances.) Tj
T*
(Environments: Crowded, noisy open-air market streets with tight queuing lines.) Tj
T*
(Interactions: Users shielded touchscreens with jackets or hands; hesitated and aborted) Tj
T*
(transactions.) Tj
T*
(Objects: Bulky ATM cabinets, large bright overhead displays.) Tj
T*
(Surprising Insight: Users were deeply anxious that bystanders in line were viewing their) Tj
T*
(account balances and PINs on the large glowing screens, causing severe social) Tj
T*
